  "source": "hand",
  "generator": null,
  "method": "Each expected value was worked out by hand from the exact decimal arithmetic in the description; none was taken from a library. alloc-fuzz is generated rather than listed: its property holds for any seed, so test/spec.test.ts also checks the generator's first draw (spec/README.md, \"Generated cases\"), which pins the stream a port must reproduce.",
